sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant Elysia
  participant Middleware as Logging, CORS, telemetry
  participant Handler as Grafserv handler
  participant Cost as Query cost and admission controls
  participant PG as PostgreSQL via Bun SQL
  Client->>Elysia: POST / with GraphQL payload
  Elysia->>Middleware: Apply request plugins
  Middleware->>Handler: Dispatch GraphQL request
  Handler->>Cost: Validate and admit operation
  Cost->>PG: Execute with role and query limits
  PG-->>Handler: Data or execution errors
  Handler-->>Client: GraphQL response
